[I] Dynamic Universal Music Bibliotheque

[T] Dynamic Universal Music Bibliotheque - DUMB - Module/tracker based music
[T] format parser and player library -- Please consider using libopenmpt
[T] instead of this, it's considerably faster and produces similar or better
[T] rendering quality

[U] https://github.com/kode54/dumb
[U] http://dumb.sf.net/

[A] Christopher Snowhill
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

# ZLIB like license
[L] Custom
[V] 2.0.3

[D] ba3ea31435861a2fbde3d3f05448c0de3cc107a7bddf64ad571757bc dumb-2.0.3.tar.gz https://github.com/kode54/dumb/archive/2.0.3/

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_EXAMPLES=OFF
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_ALLEGRO4=OFF
[ "$SDECFG_STATIC" = 0 ] && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON
